---
// Comeback narrative shared by the home page and the About page:
// e-commerce detour → 2025 Top 47 nationwide. Sits right after the
// first-deal story block, same navy treatment.
interface Props {
  /** home page links out to the full story; the About page doesn't need it */
  showStoryLink?: boolean;
}
const { showStoryLink = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section-pad border-t border-white/10 bg-navy-900">
  <div class="container-site">
    <h2 class="text-[26px] text-gold-500 sm:text-4xl">From Setbacks to a Nationwide Top 47</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-navy-100">
      <p>
        My journey wasn’t a straight line. After years in real estate, I stepped away to build an
        e-commerce business — a detour that taught me digital marketing, data, and systems thinking
        that most agents never get to learn.
      </p>
      <p>
        In late 2024, I returned to property. Within one year, I closed 2025 as a
        <strong class="font-bold text-gold-500"> Million Dollar Achiever (Diamond)</strong> and ranked
        <strong class="font-bold text-gold-500"> Top 47 nationwide</strong> in the primary market —
        proof that doing right by clients never goes out of style.
      </p>
      <p>
        That’s why my clients today get both: a decade of hard-won property experience, and a
        modern, data-driven approach to finding the right home.
      </p>
      {showStoryLink && (
        <p>
          <a
            href="https://lawrencelawproperty.com/about"
            class="font-semibold text-gold-500 transition-colors hover:text-gold-600"
          >
            Read my full story →
          </a>
        </p>
      )}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
